<title>ISRAEL: Israelis told to stick to routine.</title>
<headline>Israelis told to stick to routine.</headline>
<dateline>JERUSALEM 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Israel said on Tuesday it was following events in Iraq and told citizens to continue with life as normal.</p>
<p>&quot;The defence establishment in Israel is following what's happening. The public in Israel can continue with life as normal and there is no need to take any sort of steps,&quot; defence ministry spokesman Avi Benayahu said.</p>
</text>
